  "promotion": {
    "state": "withheld",
    "reason": "Withheld on 2026-09-11 although it qualified. Local Store offers open-source apps only, and Joplin Server is licensed under the Joplin Server Personal Use License rather than the AGPL-3.0 that covers Joplin's apps. GitHub reports NOASSERTION for the repository, which let it through the ranking. Its earlier failures were Local Store's own bug — the health probe left the port out of the Host header, and Joplin answers that with 404."
