  "data_storage": "Local Store managed folder / joplin",
  "risk_notes": [
    "Creates 2 Docker containers and publishes one port on this computer's loopback interface only.",
    "Generates 1 credential of its own, keeps it beside the app's data, and reuses it if you reinstall.",
    "Keeps its data in this app's managed folder. A keep-data uninstall leaves it; deleting data removes it permanently.",
    "Proven on Windows with Docker's Linux engine. macOS and Linux hosts are unverified.",
    "Joplin Server is not open source: packages/server is under the Joplin Server Personal Use License, a non-commercial licence, though the Joplin apps are AGPL-3.0."
